    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "llen-flow-text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 724,
      "width": 215,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "LLen\n\n1. LoadMetadata(key, kList)\n2. key 不存在或已过期 -> 0\n3. 类型不匹配 -> FailedPrecondition\n4. 成功 -> meta.size\n\n不扫描 data key，长度来自 metadata。",
      "originalText": "LLen\n\n1. LoadMetadata(key, kList)\n2. key 不存在或已过期 -> 0\n3. 类型不匹配 -> FailedPrecondition\n4. 成功 -> meta.size\n\n不扫描 data key，长度来自 metadata。",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
